c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fatbYi lnCFtg pf-301_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cXPBhi kkWDYP pf-302_ pf-heading-2-h2">Why Choose<br><b>The Andatech Soberlive FRX</b>?<br></h2></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-304_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;--s-lg:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fatbYi lnCFtg pf-305_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cXPBhi kkWDYP pf-306_ pf-heading-3-h3">Keep Your Team Safe<br></h3><p class="sc-bhqpXc fHzOVK pf-308_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-ccab5dda-823b-4537-b353-a509475a5311"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Stop alcohol-related incidents before they happen. By testing employees before they start work, you ensure a sober, safe, and productive environment every day.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-311_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;--s-lg:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fatbYi lnCFtg pf-312_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cXPBhi kkWDYP pf-313_ pf-heading-3-h3">Stay Fully Compliant<br></h3><p class="sc-bhqpXc fHzOVK pf-315_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-c32e6cce-62b3-46d4-acb4-72073925de35"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Easily meet workplace safety regulations with automated alcohol screening and digital records that make audits and compliance stress-free.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-318_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;--s-lg:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fatbYi lnCFtg pf-319_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cXPBhi kkWDYP pf-320_ pf-heading-3-h3">Avoid Downtime a